# README-slice collector (repo-root, sibling to help/).
#
# The scheduled readme-refresh workflow (.github/workflows/refresh-readme.yml)
# commits each tool's deduced README slice here as content/<slug>/README.md.
# See docs/specs/readme-extraction-contract.md (§8 Pull model).
#
# This directory is committed (via this .gitkeep) so it exists at build time even
# before any slice has been pulled: ReadmeSlice.astro ascends to the repo root by
# locating this `content/` directory, then degrades a missing per-tool slice to a
# neutral placeholder (an expected interim state — same discipline as a missing
# help/<tool>.json). Tool slices are NOT committed by the change that ships this
# machinery; they land over time from the daily pull, like the help producers.
